{"id":"molodost_","lemma":"молодость","pos":"noun","rank":4439,"glosses":["youth (state of being young)","youth (period in life)"],"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/4/46/Ru-%D0%BC%D0%BE%D0%BB%D0%BE%D0%B4%D0%BE%D1%81%D1%82%D1%8C.ogg/Ru-%D0%BC%D0%BE%D0%BB%D0%BE%D0%B4%D0%BE%D1%81%D1%82%D1%8C.ogg.mp3","gender":"f","forms":{"genitive":"молодости"},"examples":[{"text":"Это напоминает мне мою молодость.","en":"It reminds me of my youth.","words":[{"g":"this / it is"},{"g":"to remind (cause one to…","l":"напоминать"},{"g":"(to) me","l":"я"},{"g":"my, mine","l":"мой"},null]},{"text":"В молодости она была красивая.","en":"She was beautiful when she was young.","words":[{"g":"in"},null,{"g":"she / it"},{"g":"was","l":"быть"},{"g":"beautiful, handsome","l":"красивый"}]},{"text":"В молодости мой папа был хулиганом.","en":"In his youth, my dad was a hooligan.","words":[{"g":"in"},null,{"g":"my"},{"g":"dad, daddy"},{"g":"was","l":"быть"},null]},{"text":"Молодость уходит и больше не возвращается.","en":"Youth goes away and never comes back.","words":[null,{"g":"to leave","l":"уходить"},{"g":"and"},{"g":"any more"},{"g":"not"},{"g":"to return","l":"возвращаться"}]},{"text":"Она вышла замуж по молодости.","en":"She married young.","words":[{"g":"she / it"},{"g":"to exit, to go out","l":"выйти"},{"g":"married"},{"g":"along / by"},null]}]}